thmani":"١","location":"63:1:18","transliteration":{"text":null}}],"translation":"İkiyüzlüler sana gelince: \"Senin şüphesiz Allah'ın Peygamberi olduğuna şehadet ederiz\" derler. Allah, senin kendisinin peygamberi olduğunu bilir; bunun yanında Allah, ikiyüzlülerin yalancı olduklarını da bilir.","transliteration":"idhā jāaka l-munāfiqūna qālū nashhadu innaka larasūlu l-lahi wal-lahu yaʿlamu innaka larasūluhu wal-lahu yashhadu inna l-munāfiqīna lakādhibūna"},{"id":5190,"verse_key":"63:2","verse_number":2,"words":[{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱتَّخَذُوٓا۟","location":"63:2:1","transliteration":{"text":"ittakhadhū"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"أَيْمَـٰنَهُمْ","location":"63:2:2","transliteration":{"text":"aymānahum"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"جُنَّةًۭ","location":"63:2:3","transliteration":{"text":"junnatan"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"فَصَدُّوا۟","location":"63:2:4","transliteration":{"text":"faṣaddū"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"عَن","location":"63:2:5","transliteration":{"text":"ʿan"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"سَبِيلِ","location":"63:2:6","transliteration":{"text":"sabīli"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","location":"63:2:7","transliteration":{"text":"l-lahi"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُمْ","location":"63:2:8","transliteration":{"text":"innahum"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"سَآءَ","location":"63:2:9","transliteration":{"text":"sāa"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"مَا","location":"63:2:10","transliteration":{"text":"mā"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","location":"63:2:11","transliteration":{"text":"kānū"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"يَعْمَلُونَ","location":"63:2:12","transliteration":{"text":"yaʿmalūna"}},{"char_type_name":"end","text_uthmani":"٢","location":"63:2:13","transliteration":{"text":null}}],"translation":"Onlar, yeminlerini kalkan edinerek Allah'ın yolundan alıkoyarlar.